<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bakımdayız | <%= settings.firmaAdi %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-gray: #64748b;
            --primary-accent: #0ea5e9;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-main);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 40px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            margin: 20px;
        }
        .icon {
            font-size: 80px;
            color: var(--primary-accent);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 0.8; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        h1 {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .contact {
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #25D366;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(37,211,102,0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <i class="fas fa-tools icon"></i>
        <h1>Kısa Bir Mola!</h1>
        <p>Sizlere daha iyi hizmet verebilmek için sistemlerimizde kısa süreli bir güncelleme yapıyoruz. Lütfen daha sonra tekrar deneyin.</p>
        
        <% if (settings.whatsappActive && settings.whatsapp) { %>
        <div class="contact">
            <p style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:15px;">Acil iletişim ve siparişleriniz için bize WhatsApp'tan ulaşabilirsiniz:</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/<%= settings.whatsapp %>" class="btn" target="_blank">
                <i class="fab fa-whatsapp" style="font-size:20px;"></i> WhatsApp Destek
            </a>
        </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
